C03: a failure final that says the application has no open window is not a reversed polarity (CLOSE1371)

With the window_not_found cause fact, the narrator wrote «No se pudo cerrar Steam porque no tiene ninguna ventana abierta» and the failure-polarity veto rejected every draft as reversed_polarity because it matched «abiert…» regardless of negation; the turn ended in no_response.

llm.compose_visible_defect: «abiert…» / «is open» counts as a success claim only when it is not negated in its clause («no tiene ninguna ventana abierta», «no está abierto», «is not open» state the absence).

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


